    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Kakurenbo Neko is an adorably relaxing game about setting up a kitty cat adoption service.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1375790/extras/f417d6a8cf1493766e5db59194626d26.poster.avif?t=1752570904\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1375790/extras/f417d6a8cf1493766e5db59194626d26.webm?t=1752570904\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1375790/extras/f417d6a8cf1493766e5db59194626d26.mp4?t=1752570904\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><u>CUSTOMISE YOUR SHELTER</u></strong>\u00a0<strong><u> </u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">100s of unique pieces to use to customise your adoption shelter. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1375790/extras/0780ae359a977a96c382e685b615932c.poster.avif?t=1752570904\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1375790/extras/0780ae359a977a96c382e685b615932c.webm?t=1752570904\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1375790/extras/0780ae359a977a96c382e685b615932c.mp4?t=1752570904\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u><strong>DOWSING ROD?</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">That's right, and this magical twig points its way too pretty kitties close by! So forget calling the fire department and start poking at the leaves to find those little feisty felines.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1375790/extras/88f8b4a6567d02543f330249e30f7e51.poster.avif?t=1752570904\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1375790/extras/88f8b4a6567d02543f330249e30f7e51.webm?t=1752570904\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1375790/extras/88f8b4a6567d02543f330249e30f7e51.mp4?t=1752570904\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><u>Unlock loads of cool plant based tools to help find those kittnes</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A few Chihuahuas have been caught up in all the excitement! Could they be the ones chasing the cats up into the trees?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Cat Display\u00a0</strong> <br>Show you favorite cats on display in your shop. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Kitty Collector </strong> <br>Roll and Collect a large variety of special cats from the Gacha Machine. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Levels</strong><br>50+ levels with 17 unique environments.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Steam Deck</strong><br>The game is the perfect relaxation game built for the steam deck and your favourite game controller but works beautifully with a mouse and keyboard too.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Kakurenbo Neko is an adorably relaxing game about setting up a kitty cat adoption service.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1375790/extras/f417d6a8cf1493766e5db59194626d26.poster.avif?t=1752570904\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1375790/extras/f417d6a8cf1493766e5db59194626d26.webm?t=1752570904\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1375790/extras/f417d6a8cf1493766e5db59194626d26.mp4?t=1752570904\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><u>CUSTOMISE YOUR SHELTER</u></strong>\u00a0<strong><u> </u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">100s of unique pieces to use to customise your adoption shelter. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1375790/extras/0780ae359a977a96c382e685b615932c.poster.avif?t=1752570904\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1375790/extras/0780ae359a977a96c382e685b615932c.webm?t=1752570904\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1375790/extras/0780ae359a977a96c382e685b615932c.mp4?t=1752570904\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u><strong>DOWSING ROD?</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">That's right, and this magical twig points its way too pretty kitties close by! So forget calling the fire department and start poking at the leaves to find those little feisty felines.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1375790/extras/88f8b4a6567d02543f330249e30f7e51.poster.avif?t=1752570904\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1375790/extras/88f8b4a6567d02543f330249e30f7e51.webm?t=1752570904\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1375790/extras/88f8b4a6567d02543f330249e30f7e51.mp4?t=1752570904\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><u>Unlock loads of cool plant based tools to help find those kittnes</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A few Chihuahuas have been caught up in all the excitement! Could they be the ones chasing the cats up into the trees?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Cat Display\u00a0</strong> <br>Show you favorite cats on display in your shop. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Kitty Collector </strong> <br>Roll and Collect a large variety of special cats from the Gacha Machine. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Levels</strong><br>50+ levels with 17 unique environments.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Steam Deck</strong><br>The game is the perfect relaxation game built for the steam deck and your favourite game controller but works beautifully with a mouse and keyboard too.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>",
